{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14047","headline":"赠兴平郑明府 · 耿湋","name":"赠兴平郑明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海内兵犹在，关西赋未均。\n仍劳持斧使，尚宰茂陵人。\n遥夜重城掩，清宵片月新。\n绿琴听古调，白屋被深仁。\n迹与儒生合，心惟静者亲。\n深情先结契，薄宦早趋尘。\n贫病休何日，艰难过此身。\n悠悠行远道，冉冉过良辰。\n明主知封事，长沮笑问津。\n栖遑忽相见，欲语泪沾巾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿湋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14047.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14047","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}